{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026esggn7rcPm1793256690.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>股評人連敬涵於節目中推介蒙牛乳業(2319)，除了業績明顯好轉，盈利增速見效，產品結構升級，針對運動人士的蛋白水打開新的收入增長，因此股價保持強勢。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"4323.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026YDdzuulMgt1793256699.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>連敬涵認為18元可買入，目標價上望20元，若失守17元便止蝕。</p><p></p><p>蒙牛乳業(2319)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：$18</p><p>目標：$20</p><p>止蝕：$17</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"4324.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Vln0sTPXVS1793256713.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>股評人趙晞文推介華潤萬象生活(1209)，一來市佔率提升，相信在第四季數據會反映，另外是估值較過往五年的平均值有約30%的折讓，考慮公司執行能力較高的情況，加上盈利能見度高，因此有估值重估空間。</p><p></p><p>趙晞文認為股價稍微回調至38元便可買入，目標價看43元，止蝕價在34元。</p><p></p><p>華潤萬象生活(1209)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：$38</p><p>目標：$43</p><p>止蝕：$34</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:41:33.831954+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T13:59:03.828591+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:38:18.545864+00:00","content_hash":"367cec1bf1bbaf9dee403fe4c6080d710d6a6f0731c2bdedd14a77ff26ae94a5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:41:33.831954+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}